## SQ-BM-03 | baby squid from the old world stays a baby; config carried
@group A (old save, boot 2 of SQ-RFX-25)
@commands `> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:squid,limit=1,sort=nearest,x=0,y=-59,z=12] Age`; `grep -n squidBabyChance config/babymobs-common.toml`; `grep -E "babymobs.mixins.json" logs/debug.log \| head -3`
@pass the squid's `Age` is still negative (about -24000 plus the ticks since boot 1); `squidBabyChance = 0.75` in `babymobs-common.toml`, no `baby_mobs-common.toml` left; the common mixins apply from `babymobs.mixins.json`, no mixin error naming `babymobs`
@fails Age 0: `MobBabyMixin` did not run (the mixin config name in the member manifest); the chance back at 0.05: `ConfigRename.carryOver` in `CreativeWorldgen`
@superseded by SQ-UPG-11 (1.2.02 upgrade section) (owner ruling 1, 2026-11-18)
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:squid,limit=1,sort=nearest,x=0,y=-59,z=12] Age
expect Age: -
shell grep -n squidBabyChance config/babymobs-common.toml; ls config | grep -c "^baby_mobs-common.toml$" || true
shell ! grep -E "babymobs\S*mixins.*(error|Error|failed)" logs/latest.log
